{"product_id":"tabata-workout-handbook","title":"Tabata Workout Handbook","description":"\u003cp\u003eTabata is the most efficient way to exercise in the world, requiring less time than any other method of fitness. Utilising principles of High Intensity Interval Training (HIIT), Tabata is now widely acknowledged to be the single most advantageous form of exercise for any number of fitness goals. Compiles a collection of more than 100 Tabata workouts optimised for effective weight loss, increased cardiovascular health, and improved athletic ability. Simple and effective, these Tabata workouts can be done anywhere and anytime. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:203 x 254  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Roger Hall \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781578265619 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 144\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44898552742041,"sku":"11RD9781578265619","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/ae4d91a4b1612f30598a9bb0ff79baf6.jpg?v=1729003203","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/tabata-workout-handbook","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}